{"title":"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The polynomial\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/e/d0e876e86acd744066aee265d810d8d0186d0dde.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[P(x)=x^3+ax^2+bx+c\\]\" width=\"200\" height=\"20\" />\nis divisble by the polynomial\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b137b97b6bfbfeaad8d5646084f18ef9cf0a80c9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[Q(x)=x^2+\\frac{1}{40}\\]\" width=\"123\" height=\"37\" />\nFind the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/6/8362dd17da7c07cedd4018d589a0b21e9575e287.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"12\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6efaaf74e576202fad965134bc49c6a34aac4c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> can be rewritten as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/f/93f4067c707a9d3e975c2389b9ed318180bcc8af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)=Q(x)R(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"142\" height=\"20\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dfe7c7a0b887097fa2227a230fc915ba2e5477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> is a monic polynomial with a degree of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/e/a3eeefa367883375994fd2e1f575d088bce9d8b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"40\" height=\"20\" /> must also be a monic polynomial, but with a degree of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/b/97b9d7eb72e4249bb741904f27d13bcff6ebcc6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R(x)=x+p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"106\" height=\"20\" />. We can then rewrite <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6efaaf74e576202fad965134bc49c6a34aac4c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> as:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/5/aa593174954629bd03812dfe93871bf58a736377.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[P(x)=Q(x)R(x)=\\left(x^2+\\frac{1}{40}\\right)(x+p)=x^3+px^2 +\\frac{1}{40}x+\\frac{p}{40}\\]\" width=\"500\" height=\"43\" />\nSubstituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/e/69ec96efde8d16001510f04f16401e3a945fe848.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)=x^3+ax^2+bx+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"203\" height=\"21\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/9/a69717eb49896401aafedbf1a2685f46d398d918.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^3+ax^2+bx+c=x^3+px^2+ \\frac{1}{40}x+\\frac{p}{40}\\]\" width=\"326\" height=\"37\" />\nSince they are equivalent polynomials, we can equate each coefficient to get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/1/6d17f0145a3b31e966836705f808681474075fb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"11\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/3/a130cc04064435126f17d323ad3f267a3e9650aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=\\frac{1}{40}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"56\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/9/1092d974dc4e830e204078bbddcc2bf54a4f1779.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=\\frac{p}{40}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"56\" height=\"34\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nThen, the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/6/8362dd17da7c07cedd4018d589a0b21e9575e287.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"12\" height=\"33\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/1/ba140ddbfd4078c45d1a53913fc4b650abe75518.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{p}{\\frac{p}{40}}=\\boxed{40}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"77\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO\">2026 Indonesia District MO </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_Indonesia_District_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2026 Indonesia District MO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.p